    "result_text": "All tests pass (12 run, 0 failures). \n\n## Summary\n\nI implemented the `initials` field on the owner API response, which returns the upper-cased first letters of `firstName` and `lastName`, dot-separated with a trailing dot (e.g. `J.S.`).\n\nTwo changes, following the existing pattern used for the `displayName` computed field:\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 Added an `initials` (read-only string) property to the `Owner` schema, so the OpenAPI generator produces the field on `OwnerDto`.\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 Added a MapStruct `@Mapping` that computes the value: `Character.toUpperCase(firstName.charAt(0)) + \".\" + Character.toUpperCase(lastName.charAt(0)) + \".\"`.\n\nThe new `Cp06Tests` (`john`/`smith` \u2192 `J.S.`) passes, and the full suite is green (12/12).",
